<report>
<title>Sample size for survival analysis</title>

<p>median survival time for controls = <inu>ctFmt</inu><br />
hazard ratio = <inu>hrFmt</inu><br />
accrual time for recruitment = <inu>atFmt</inu><br />
additional follow-up time after recruitment = <inu>futFmt</inu><br />
alpha = <inu>alpha</inu><br />
power = <inu>power</inu></p>

<p>Estimated minimum sample size = <in>size</in> experimental subjects and <in>controls</in> controls</p>
<block name="assumptions">

<p><warn>NB:Assumptions of this calculation may cause over estimation of sample size when power is low.  However, true power associated with <in>cases</in> cases will be no less than <in>no_less</in> and no greater than <in>no_greater</in>.</warn></p>
</block>
</report>
